# Champions (m3 tasks 3.1/3.3, BALANCE §14). Needs Arpgtest online. Rules, not rates: the Champion is made by command (the
# same code the 2% first-sight roll calls); the blue chance is forced to 100% so the loot floor is fully checked.
# Level 20 in Northshire: band 15 (+1 level, 2.5x health, 1.3x damage, 1-2 affixes, 2-3 minions); zone cap 20 -> level 21.

> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 20 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
> .arpg test clearbags Arpgtest
? ok
> .arpg config set Arpg.Test.RecordEvents 1
? ok
> .arpg config set Arpg.Champion.LootBlueChance 100
? ok

> .arpg champion make Arpgtest 49871
# Tagged: its own creature type "Champion <name>" (Rare portrait in the client).
? ok Arpgtest champion entry=49871 tag=Champion Blackrock Battle Worg level=21 band=15 hp=\d+ minions=[23] affixes=[12] \[
# Only soft affixes or the Enchanted ones (unlocked at 15); Arcane Caster needs 25.
! Arcane Caster

# The scaling tick leaves a Champion alone (pinned).
~ 2500
> .arpg champion info Arpgtest
? champion entry=49871 tag=Champion Blackrock Battle Worg level=21 .* alive=1 pinned=1

# Kill: health orb (from 50% health), loot floor = a green + a blue added to its loot.
> .arpg config set Arpg.Catalyst.ChampionChance 100
? ok
> .arpg test events Arpgtest clear
? ok
> .arpg champion kill Arpgtest
? ok Arpgtest killed champion entry=49871 health_pct=([6-9]\d|100) loot_items=([2-9]|\d\d)
> .arpg test events Arpgtest
? champion killed entry=49871 orb_health=[1-9]\d* orb_power=\d+ floor_green=[1-9]\d* floor_blue=[1-9]\d*
# Rolled at the kill: each corpse item carries its final name (suffix id) before anyone loots it.
? loot plan item=\d+ rp=-30\d\d\d n=[1-5] unique=0 champion
# Catalyst of its band (level 21 -> T2 -> Lesser), forced to 100% for the test.
? catalyst drop item=700001 tier=2\b
> .arpg config set Arpg.Catalyst.ChampionChance 25
? ok

# Items looted from the Champion roll with +1 tier (event marked "champion").
> .arpg champion loot Arpgtest
? ok Arpgtest looted=([2-9]|\d\d)
> .arpg test events Arpgtest
? affix item=\d+ guid=\d+ q=2 n=\d+ champion
? affix item=\d+ guid=\d+ q=3 n=\d+ champion

# --- Monster affixes (m3 task 3.2). Forced ids: 4 Fire, 5 Cold, 6 Lightning Enchanted, 7 Arcane Caster. Damage is a % of
# max health (band 15: 15%), never a kill. Forced procs make Lightning spark on every hit.
> .arpg config set Arpg.Test.ForceProcs 1
? ok
> .arpg champion make Arpgtest 49871 affix 5,6
? affixes=2 \[Cold Enchanted,Lightning Enchanted\]
> .arpg test events Arpgtest clear
? ok
> .arpg champion strike Arpgtest 6
? ok struck by champion
> .arpg test events Arpgtest
? champion chill spell=6136
? champion sparks dmg=[1-9]
> .arpg champion kill Arpgtest
? ok .* killed champion

# Fire Enchanted: the blast goes off 1.5 s after the kill at the corpse (the character stands 4 yards away: hit).
> .arpg champion make Arpgtest 49871 affix 4
? affixes=1 \[Fire Enchanted\]
> .arpg test events Arpgtest clear
? ok
> .arpg champion kill Arpgtest
? ok .* killed champion
> .arpg test events Arpgtest
? champion explosion pending dmg=[1-9]
! champion explosion dmg=
~ 2500
> .arpg test events Arpgtest
? champion explosion dmg=[1-9]

# Arcane Caster: starts an interruptible cast at its target; the hit is a % of max health.
> .arpg champion make Arpgtest 49871 affix 7
? \[Arcane Caster\]
> .arpg test events Arpgtest clear
? ok
> .arpg champion strike Arpgtest 1
? in_combat=1
~ 5000
> .arpg test events Arpgtest
? champion nuke cast entry=49871 casting=1
? champion nuke dmg=[1-9]
> .arpg champion kill Arpgtest
? ok .* killed champion
> .arpg config set Arpg.Test.ForceProcs 0
? ok

# --- Other bands (BALANCE §14): a fresh character gets an easy one; at 90 the full numbers.
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 5 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
> .arpg champion make Arpgtest 49871
? champion entry=49871 tag=Champion Blackrock Battle Worg level=5 band=1 hp=\d+ minions=1 affixes=1 \[(Extra Strong|Extra Fast|Stoneskin)\]
> .arpg champion kill Arpgtest
? ok .* killed champion
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 90 jadeforest-dawnsblossom
? ok .*\(online\)
~ 6000
> .arpg champion make Arpgtest 49871
? champion entry=49871 tag=Champion Blackrock Battle Worg level=90 band=60 hp=\d+ minions=[2-4] affixes=2 \[
> .arpg champion kill Arpgtest
? ok .* killed champion
# Low level (owner 2026-11-27: a level-4 kill dropped no floor items - hardly any blues exist that low): the blue floor
# falls back to a green at the level, so both floor items are there.
> .arpg config set Arpg.Test.RecordEvents 1
? ok
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 4 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
~ 6000
> .arpg champion make Arpgtest 299
? champion entry=299
> .arpg test events Arpgtest clear
? ok
> .arpg champion kill Arpgtest
? ok .* killed champion
> .arpg test events Arpgtest
? champion killed entry=299 .*floor_green=[1-9]\d* floor_blue=[1-9]\d*
# Loot beam (owner pick 120720): the corpse holds a green and a blue -> a beam goes up; looting it takes the beam down.
? loot beam corpse=(400)?299\b
> .arpg champion loot Arpgtest
? ok
~ 2500
> .arpg test beams Arpgtest
? ok beams=0
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 20 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
~ 6000

# Back to the conf values (Champion chance was set to 0 by 00-smoke for the test run).
> .arpg reload
? ok .*monster bands
